'''Stilts Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] increases health, attack power and [[Knockback|Knockback]] chance. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]].

