==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Stilts Cat was a part of three other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Nostalgia (Removed Combo)|Nostalgia]], [[With a View (Removed Combo)|With a View]] and [[Face Paint (Removed Combo)|Face Paint]].
*Stilts Cat's English description might be a reference to star stilts, a kind of tool made using spike and plastic.
*Stilts Cat's design may be a nod to Stilts Panda, the [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] equivalent in [[Kumanchu Royale]].
**Stilts Panda evolves into Totem Panda just like how Stilts Cat evolves into Totem Cat, though Totem Cat more closely resembles real [[wikipedia:Totem pole|totem poles]].
*The "cheap Swedish furniture" in Acrobat Cats' English description is referencing the Swedish furniture retail company [[wikipedia:IKEA|IKEA]].

